WEBVTT

00:01:57.561 --> 00:02:01.139
will not have it when they must have it.

00:02:02.777 --> 00:02:06.872
The biggest crisis in Africa today
is the crisis of knowledge:

00:02:06.896 --> 00:02:08.916
how to produce it,

00:02:08.940 --> 00:02:10.571
how to manage it,

00:02:10.595 --> 00:02:13.303
and how to deploy it effectively.

00:02:14.421 --> 00:02:18.474
For instance, Africa does not
have a water crisis.

00:02:19.284 --> 00:02:22.218
It has a knowledge crisis
regarding its water,

00:02:23.251 --> 00:02:25.738
where and what types it is,

00:02:25.762 --> 00:02:31.766
how it can be tapped and made available
where and when needed to all and sundry.